# Ignore video files
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
# The sign-in background clip is a shipped asset, not a working file. This must
# stay below the **/*.mp4 rule above — a negation cannot resurrect a path whose
# exclusion appears after it.
!public/video/*.mp4
# Ignore Adobe Premiere preview indexes
**/*.prin
# Ignore exported agent transcripts kept alongside real planning docs
_PLANS/chat-*.md
